      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We are genuinely sorry to read about your disappointing experience at The Azure Stay; this absolutely does not reflect the high standards we strive to uphold for our guests. Please accept our sincerest apologies regarding the cold food and service delays you encountered during breakfast. We would greatly appreciate the opportunity to discuss this further and make things right for you directly. Could you please send us a direct message with your reservation details so we can personally address this situation?",
